---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy \u2013 GalexyKeyboard" description="GalexyKeyboard privacy policy: all typing happens locally in your browser. No text is transmitted, logged or stored.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <p><strong>Your text never leaves your device.</strong> All typing, copying and downloading on GalexyKeyboard happens locally in your browser. We do not transmit, log, or store anything you type.</p>
      <p><strong>No accounts.</strong> The tool requires no registration and collects no personal information.</p>
      <p><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is served as static files. Our hosting provider may record standard technical logs (such as IP address and requested URL) needed to deliver the site securely.</p>
      <p><strong>Cookies.</strong> GalexyKeyboard itself sets no tracking cookies. However, we use third-party advertising networks (including effectivecpmnetwork.com and highperformanceformat.com) to display ads on our site. These services may set their own cookies to serve and personalise advertisements. By continuing to use our site, you consent to the use of these cookies for advertising purposes. You can control cookie behaviour through your browser settings.</p>
      <p><strong>Advertising.</strong> Ads displayed on GalexyKeyboard are served by third-party networks. We do not control the content of these ads, and the ad networks may collect anonymised usage data in accordance with their own privacy policies. No text you type in the keyboard tool is shared with any advertising partner.</p>
      <p>Questions? Reach us via the contact page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
